              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BonnieKitchenFaerie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fabulous! The best strawberry pie I've ever had!\nI followed the recipe pretty closely as written, with a few exceptions:\n\nI substituted:\n-- margine for the butter,\n-- Granny Smith apple + 2 Tbs. flour in place of 1 cup of the rhubarb (I was short that cup, so the apple was a good compensation)\n--Also, I baked this as an open-top, rather than a covered pie.\n\nMy husband and I loved it, and I will be sure to bake this again, esp. for parties!",
